{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 15, :comments ["<b>Every disease.</b> Even those that habitually arise from the natural order." "<b>The bad ones.</b> Those that cling." "<b>Which you knew.</b> That struck at the sea, as explained above." "<b>He will not put them upon you, but will put them upon all your enemies.</b> Even though He puts them upon your enemies, they will not cling to you, as in: יִפֹּל מִצִּדְּךָ אֶלֶף, אֵלֶיךָ לֹא יִגָּשׁ (Psalms 91:7)."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 7, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:20:49.264422481Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}